{"id":"hafen","lemma":"Hafen","pos":"noun","rank":2085,"glosses":["harbour/harbor; port; haven"],"ipa":"/ˈhaːfn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/De-Hafen.ogg/De-Hafen.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Hafens","plural":"Häfen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Schiff ist jetzt im Hafen.","en":"The ship is now in the harbor.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Das ist ein Häfen.","en":"This is a pot.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Die Insel hat einen schönen Hafen.","en":"The island has a fine harbor.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"an island, an isle"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},null]},{"text":"Im Hafen liegen viele Schiffe.","en":"There are many ships in the harbor.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to lie"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"ship","l":"Schiff"}]},{"text":"Ihr Schiff liegt noch immer im Hafen.","en":"Their ship is still in port.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}